Microsoft components
--------------------

The distribution includes an unmodified Microsoft SimConnect.dll obtained
from the Microsoft Flight Simulator SDK and may include the official Microsoft
Edge WebView2 bootstrapper. These components are not licensed under the
NaviXav PolyForm licence and remain subject to the applicable Microsoft terms.
Microsoft, Microsoft Flight Simulator, MSFS, Edge and WebView2 are trademarks
of the Microsoft group of companies.

